{"id":"n72163-1-11","stage":5,"title":"캠퍼스 · 校园","scene":"校园与学习","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72163-1-11-1","ko":"캠퍼스가 한산해졌네.","zh":"校园里变得冷清了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"캠퍼스가","meaning":"校园","explanation":"캠퍼스：校园；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"캠퍼스","audio":"/audio/d80776c48f663fa4f7d8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72163","senseId":"1","lemma":"캠퍼스","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"캠퍼스가","audio":"/audio/5abf8b7385becd0e11bb.mp3"}},{"text":"한산해졌네.","meaning":"清闲，清净；表示成为前面表达的状态。","explanation":"한산하다：清闲，清净；지다：表示成为前面表达的状态；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"한산하다","audio":"/audio/d92c2683bb0f069e1944.mp3"},{"term":"지다","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84908","senseId":"2","lemma":"한산하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"77247","senseId":"3","lemma":"지다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한산해졌네","audio":"/audio/bdc89ad78c24774d376c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d80776c48f663fa4","term":"캠퍼스","zh":"校园","audio":"/audio/d80776c48f663fa4f7d8.mp3","entryId":"72163","definition":"拥有建筑物和操场等设施的大学的特定区域。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"d92c2683bb0f069e","term":"한산하다","zh":"清闲，清净","audio":"/audio/d92c2683bb0f069e1944.mp3","entryId":"84908","definition":"人们之间往来少，安静冷清。","pronunciation":["한산하다"]},{"id":"6fde84679c7f2c31","term":"지다","zh":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","audio":"/audio/6fde84679c7f2c315bb0.mp3","entryId":"77247","definition":"表示成为前面表达的状态。","pronunciation":["지다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4bec7fb4ba40c3cdb26a.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n72163-1-11-2","ko":"응. 기말시험이 다 끝나서 그럴 거야.","zh":"嗯，应该是期末考试都结束了的缘故吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading"